DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260801T170000
UID:9bd8de7d019004ca451591f020f50e4a@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Join Community Market at our annual Community Wellness Fair fo
 r a full day of wellness\, learning\, self-care\, and community connection
 . This year’s fair brings together local practitioners\, educators\, mak
 ers\, and wellness-focused businesses for a day centered around care\, dis
 covery\, and well-being. Guests will have the opportunity to explore a wid
 e range of offerings\, including one-on-one wellness services\, educationa
 l speakers\, local vendors\, a curated wellness boutique\, food\, drinks\,
  and more. The Community Wellness Fair is a chance to connect with local w
 ellness providers\, learn about different approaches to health and well-be
 ing\, discover new resources\, and spend time in community. Whether you ar
 e looking for support\, inspiration\, education\, or simply a meaningful w
 ay to spend the day\, the fair offers something for anyone interested in w
 ellness and self-care. Attendees can browse vendor booths\, meet practitio
 ners\, enjoy wellness services\, listen to speakers\, shop thoughtfully se
 lect
URL:https://business.sebastopol.org/events/details/community-wellness-fair
 -hosted-by-community-market
X-SOURCE:Sebastopol Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
